agent_task:
Reproduce STaPLe (Self-Taught Principle Learning) Iteration 1 to verify self-improvement claim: (1) Load Llama-3.1-8B-Instruct from HuggingFace (meta-llama/Llama-3.1-8B-Instruct), (2) Prepare mining corpus sample (~10k prompts) by downloading from HuggingFace datasets (Anthropic/hh-rlhf, openbmb/UltraFeedback, or openai/summarize_from_feedback) and filtering to samples with gold/chosen responses, (3) Implement E-step: for each prompt, sample initial response from model, mine N=16 principles using principle-mining prompt (Prompt: {prompt}

Here is the previous response: {initial_response}

Here is the target response: {gold_response}

Identify a high-level principle... New Principle:), generate critiques using critique-generation prompt, sample N refined responses, select best via Rouge-L F1 similarity to gold (must exceed initial response), (4) Implement M-step: supervised fine-tune on (prompt, initial_response, principle, refined_response) tuples for 3 epochs at LR 1e-6, seq_len 4096, (5) Evaluate on IFEval (541 prompts) using Prometheus-8x7B-v2.0 judge: for each prompt, compare model's initial vs refined response on principle-following, report win-rate. Target: achieve >60% IFEval win-rate demonstrating the model learned intrinsic self-correction.
